<title>USA: Lancaster Colony buys salad crouton co.</title>
<headline>Lancaster Colony buys salad crouton co.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lancaster Colony Corp said Friday it has acquired Chatham Village Foods Inc and its line of salad croutons.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Chatham sells about $20 million of croutons each year.</p>
<p>Production of croutons is to continue at Chatham's facility in Wareham, Mass., Lancaster Colony Chairman and Chief Executive John Gerlach said in a statement.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
